WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
 So we talked with a gentleman who was

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.880
 having two to three bottles of Gatorade a

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.800
 day and he thought

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.470
 he was doing better because it wasn't pop

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:12.060
 but Gatorade has a lot of sodium in it.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:12.880
 So we encouraged

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.460
 him to reduce the Gatorade not drink as

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.030
 much and he came back to us and two weeks

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.360
 later his numbers

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.080
 went down. So he really thought that he

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.800
 was doing better by not having the sugary

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.680
 pop drinks by

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.450
 drinking the sports drink but some of

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.270
 those sports drinks have a lot of

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:30.880
 sodium. So things like

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.390
 that. So he was encouraged by that

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:35.710
 and then wanted to continue. What else

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:37.040
 what other changes

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.520
 can I make? What other things can I do?

